# Cursor Rules

- Follow standard React/Next.js conventions for the App Router.
- Prefer `lucide-react` for icons.
- Ensure strict TypeScript typing and avoid `any`.
- Keep components focused and use shadcn/ui primitives.
- When generating markup, ensure proper heading structure (h1 -> h2 -> h3) for accessibility.
- Favor Tailwind CSS classes instead of inline styles.
